# Animation skill gate

For any request to add, change, review, debug, or polish frontend animation:

- Load and follow section-motion-director before reading or editing animation code.
- Work on one explicitly named section only. Ask for target when missing. Never animate whole page without explicit scope.
- Load required stack named by that skill, including official GSAP core, React, ScrollTrigger, timeline, performance, animation, and design-craft guidance.
- Use deterministic role-aware variation, not Math.random(); report seed and selected variants.
- Keep motion early, short, reversible, responsive, scoped, cleaned up, and reduced-motion safe.
- Do not use Superdesign CLI for code-only animation. Load superdesign only for requested canvas exploration or design variants.
- Stop after one bounded verification pass and wait for section approval.
